Notice for the RFC material in this directory:
  rfc8439.txt is a byte-for-byte copy of https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc8439.txt
  (RFC 8439, "ChaCha20 and Poly1305 for IETF Protocols", Y. Nir and A. Langley, June 2018),
  fetched 2026-10-26, sha256 25bef70fbf7a07ff45c2fe4cb7c6ce954eac687413d8610603268b4e4415324c.
  rfc8439-vectors.txt is derived from it by ../gen_rfc.py (hex dumps read mechanically; inline
  values checked to occur in the cited section). Its records restate the RFC's test vectors in the
  driver's one-record-per-line format; the values themselves are not changed.

RFC 8439 carries this copyright notice (quoted from the document):
  Copyright (c) 2018 IETF Trust and the persons identified as the document authors. All rights
  reserved. This document is subject to BCP 78 and the IETF Trust's Legal Provisions Relating to
  IETF Documents (https://trustee.ietf.org/license-info) in effect on the date of publication of
  this document.
The IETF Trust Legal Provisions permit copying and distributing RFCs in full without modification.

Wycheproof material: wycheproof-chacha20-poly1305.txt and wycheproof-chacha20-counter.txt are
converted by ../gen_wycheproof.py from https://github.com/C2SP/wycheproof testvectors_v1 at commit
d17cc89fa5c8f4f4d378b5385ebf75da5d0926c9 (source sha256 in each file's header), Apache License 2.0,
copied as WYCHEPROOF.LICENSE.
